<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" seoTitle="Privacy Policy | 5 Letter Words" description="How 5 Letter Words handles your information: what is stored on your device, how the word tools run in your browser, and our use of analytics and ads.">
  <p>This policy explains what information 5 Letter Words collects and how it is used.</p>
  <h2>Information stored on your device</h2>
  <p>Display settings such as dark mode and Scrabble scores are saved in your browser’s local storage so they persist between visits. This information stays on your device and is not sent to us.</p>
  <h2>Letters you enter</h2>
  <p>The finders and unscramblers run in your browser. The letters and filters you enter are used to search the word list locally and are not uploaded to our servers.</p>
  <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
  <p>We may use third-party analytics and advertising services, which can use cookies or similar technologies to measure traffic and show ads. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The site is a general-audience word tool and is not directed at children under 13.</p>
  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Questions can be sent through our <a href="/contact-us">contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
